Description:It is your first main phase. You control Serra Angel, Grizzly Bears and three untapped Mountains, and have Stoke the Flames in hand. The opponent is at 9 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-vigilance-convoke | Attacking with vigilance does not tap the creature (CR 702.20b), and convoke taps untapped creatures to pay (CR 702.51a): attack with both for 6, then tap the still-untapped Serra Angel and the Mountains for Stoke the Flames (4); spending the Bears on Stoke before combat leaves 8
